# Manifold level 7
# The maze (stage 3j): a level drawn as text, as the dungeons a seed will make (3k). Each character
# is a cell of 2 m: # a wall 3 m tall, . floor, a space nothing (a pit, here none), and the letters the
# map's line gives a zone: C a checkpoint, * a star, G the goal. The engine makes it into as few boxes
# as rectangles cover it (`level.export` writes them).
title Maze
spawn 3 1 9
facing 0 0 1

map 0 0 0  2 3  C checkpoint  * star  G goal
###########
#...#.....#
#.#.#.###.#
#.#...#*#.#
#.#####.#.#
#...C...#.#
###.#####.#
#*..#...#.#
#.###.#.#.#
#.....#..G#
###########
end

# The void, should anything fall.
sensor fall  11 -6 11  30 3 30
